WEBVTT

00:00:10.698 --> 00:00:12.613
Goodbye.

00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:15.094
I hope I see you again,
friends.

00:00:15.137 --> 00:00:18.706
But even though it's scary,
I have to go out there

00:00:18.749 --> 00:00:21.752
and see if there's
other Trolls like me.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.886
[shrieks]

00:00:24.929 --> 00:00:27.018
Oh, man, this is gonna be hard.

00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:29.499
-BARB: All aboard!
-["Crazy Train" playing]

00:00:29.543 --> 00:00:30.718
[laughing]

00:00:30.761 --> 00:00:32.981
♪ Ai, ai, ai

00:00:33.895 --> 00:00:36.115
[rock music playing loudly]

00:00:37.464 --> 00:00:39.596
♪ Crazy

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.382
♪ But that's how it goes

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:46.516
♪ Millions of people

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.389
♪ Living as foes

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.132
♪ Music

00:00:53.175 --> 00:00:56.178
♪ Has kept us apart

00:00:57.745 --> 00:01:00.051
♪ It's time for the hard rock

00:01:00.095 --> 00:01:03.142
♪ Revolution to start

00:01:04.404 --> 00:01:08.059
♪ No spats, no tiffs,
no fighting ♪

00:01:08.103 --> 00:01:10.801
♪ When everyone's the same

00:01:11.628 --> 00:01:13.761
♪ I'm going off the rails

00:01:13.804 --> 00:01:19.549
♪ On a crazy train!

00:01:19.593 --> 00:01:22.987
-Yeah! I got the Techno string!
-[excited chatter]

00:01:23.031 --> 00:01:25.381
Who knew world domination
could be so much fun?

00:01:25.425 --> 00:01:28.428
-Yeah! -All right, Barb!
-[Trolls cheering]

00:01:28.471 --> 00:01:29.429
All right!

00:01:29.472 --> 00:01:30.778
[both yell]

00:01:30.821 --> 00:01:33.215
Ha! Queen Barb!

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:34.912
[both laugh]

00:01:34.956 --> 00:01:37.524
[heavy electric guitar
chord plays]

00:01:39.787 --> 00:01:42.398
[electric guitar riff plays]

00:01:42.442 --> 00:01:47.011
Only four more strings to go
until rock unites the world.

00:01:47.055 --> 00:01:48.012
[excited chatter]

00:01:48.056 --> 00:01:49.797
Dad? Where's Dad?

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.234
[toilet flushes]

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.454
-♪
-[engine revving]

00:01:58.893 --> 00:02:00.286
There you are, Dad.

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:02.462
-I got the Techno string.
-Cool.

00:02:02.505 --> 00:02:04.333
-What's a string ag-again?
-[back-up alarm beeping]

00:02:04.377 --> 00:02:05.465
What? Uh...

00:02:05.508 --> 00:02:07.118
-Don't you remember the plan?
-Plan?

00:02:07.162 --> 00:02:09.120
-I don't remember... [mumbles]
-Oh.

00:02:09.164 --> 00:02:10.339
-Great idea, man.
-Whoa.

00:02:10.383 --> 00:02:11.427
Okay, guys, line up.

00:02:11.471 --> 00:02:12.907
We're gonna go over
the plan again.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:13.951
[Trolls murmur, chuckle]

00:02:13.995 --> 00:02:16.563
Okay. We're on a World Tour.

00:02:16.606 --> 00:02:19.609
And on each stop,
we get a new string.

00:02:19.653 --> 00:02:21.132
When I have all six strings,

00:02:21.176 --> 00:02:23.744
I'll play the ultimate
power chord.

00:02:23.787 --> 00:02:25.136
[electric guitar chord plays]

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:28.966
And I will unite the Trolls
under one music.

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.272
Our music!

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.969
-TROLLS: Rock!
-[excited chatter]

00:02:34.842 --> 00:02:36.409
Oh, here it comes.

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:42.632
[grunting slowly]

00:02:42.676 --> 00:02:44.678
Uh, just a little bit more.

00:02:44.721 --> 00:02:46.114
Riff, just help him, man.

00:02:46.157 --> 00:02:47.333
Yes, Your Rockness.

00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:48.725
Aw.

00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:49.813
There it is.

00:02:49.857 --> 00:02:51.815
-[Trolls cheering]
-BARB: Yeah!

00:02:51.859 --> 00:02:53.513
-Rock and roll!
-Yeah!

00:02:53.556 --> 00:02:54.644
[both laugh]

00:02:54.688 --> 00:02:55.863
Yeah!

00:02:59.867 --> 00:03:01.651
[inhales deeply]

00:03:01.695 --> 00:03:03.523
-[sighs]
-All right.

00:03:03.566 --> 00:03:07.266
In a short 456 pages, I'm gonna
know how to fly this thing.

00:03:07.309 --> 00:03:08.963
-[knuckles crack]
-Ugh, Branch,

00:03:09.006 --> 00:03:11.052
we don't need
a giant, comprehensive manual.

00:03:11.095 --> 00:03:12.358
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

00:03:12.401 --> 00:03:13.620
How hard can it be?
♪ Doo-doo-doo-doo-doo.

00:03:13.663 --> 00:03:16.187
-[console beeping]
-♪ Try one of these.

00:03:16.231 --> 00:03:19.974
[Sheila B whooping, laughing]

00:03:20.017 --> 00:03:21.802
All right, Poppy!

00:03:21.845 --> 00:03:23.325
Easy on the buttons!

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:24.370
-Sorry.
-[snoring nearby]

00:03:24.413 --> 00:03:26.502
[shushes]
What was that?

00:03:26.546 --> 00:03:27.503
[sleepy murmur]

00:03:27.547 --> 00:03:29.505
[whistling exhale]

00:03:29.549 --> 00:03:30.680
[sleepy murmur]

00:03:30.724 --> 00:03:31.855
[snoring]

00:03:31.899 --> 00:03:33.509
[Mr. Dinkles sucking, cooing]

00:03:33.553 --> 00:03:34.858
Biggie?

00:03:34.902 --> 00:03:36.120
Oh, hello.

00:03:36.164 --> 00:03:37.861
Sorry. I couldn't help myself.

00:03:37.905 --> 00:03:39.689
You know how I am
around cotton candy.

00:03:39.733 --> 00:03:40.864
-[burps]
-Oh, dear.

00:03:40.908 --> 00:03:41.865
Now look what's happened.

00:03:41.909 --> 00:03:44.346
Mr. Dinkles got all gummed up.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.913
-[squeaks]
-[gasps] Mr. Dinkles!

00:03:45.956 --> 00:03:47.088
Mr. Dinkles!

00:03:47.131 --> 00:03:48.350
Oh, there you are.
I thought you were--

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:50.831
Oh. Right, then.
We'll just be on our way--

00:03:50.874 --> 00:03:52.223
[screams] Hey!

00:03:52.267 --> 00:03:54.748
Poppy, wh-where are you
balloon-flying us to?

00:03:54.791 --> 00:03:57.272
We're on a mission
to help Barb unite the Trolls,

00:03:57.316 --> 00:03:59.535
and I'm so glad
you're coming with us.

00:03:59.579 --> 00:04:00.884
I did what in the who now?

00:04:00.928 --> 00:04:02.321
Hey, man, join the club.

00:04:02.364 --> 00:04:04.366
And I hope you didn't eat
all the cotton candy,

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.325
because Barb is gonna love it.

00:04:06.368 --> 00:04:07.935
[clears throat]
Branchifer?

00:04:07.978 --> 00:04:09.197
[clears throat]
Y-Yes, Poppifer?

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.199
-What is this?
-Oh, it's nothing, nothing.

00:04:11.242 --> 00:04:13.157
-That-that-that-that's
just my man stuff. -[gasps]

00:04:13.201 --> 00:04:14.507
I love man stuff!

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:16.378
Weapons?

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:18.119
Ugh. For shame.

00:04:18.162 --> 00:04:19.338
Well, I-I...

00:04:19.381 --> 00:04:21.122
Violence never solves
a problem, Branch.

00:04:21.165 --> 00:04:22.906
-[squeaks]
-[shrieks]

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.908
I'm not saying
we have to use them.

00:04:24.952 --> 00:04:26.736
I'm just saying
it's better to be prepared

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.390
in case we need them.

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:31.262
We won't need them unless these
pointy sticks help you listen

00:04:31.306 --> 00:04:32.960
or these rocks help you
put yourself

00:04:33.003 --> 00:04:34.222
in someone else's shoes.

00:04:34.265 --> 00:04:35.745
And what about these?
Is this-- What, I--

00:04:35.789 --> 00:04:36.964
Is this some kind of jewelry?

00:04:37.007 --> 00:04:37.921
Oh, it's actually
kind of cool-looking.

00:04:37.965 --> 00:04:38.922
♪ Oh.

00:04:38.966 --> 00:04:40.315
Gi-Give me that.

00:04:40.359 --> 00:04:43.187
We don't even know
what's out there.

00:04:46.582 --> 00:04:49.063
Wait! No-- Oh, man.

00:04:49.106 --> 00:04:51.631
By the way,
I whittled those for hours.

00:04:51.674 --> 00:04:56.375
Branch, the only weapons we
need are this guy and this guy,

00:04:56.418 --> 00:04:57.463
for hugs!

00:04:57.506 --> 00:05:00.117
Uh, you may want
to take a look at this.

00:05:00.161 --> 00:05:02.337
♪

00:05:05.035 --> 00:05:07.081
[fire crackling softly]

00:05:08.082 --> 00:05:11.128
This is gonna take
a lot of hugs.

00:05:11.172 --> 00:05:13.392
♪

00:05:25.012 --> 00:05:26.143
Whoa.

00:05:26.187 --> 00:05:28.450
Something gnarly happened here.

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:30.147
PENNYWHISTLE:
Hello?

00:05:30.191 --> 00:05:31.801
Who said that?

00:05:31.845 --> 00:05:34.325
Identify yourself!

00:05:34.369 --> 00:05:39.113
PENNYWHISTLE: Uh, are you nice
or are you mean?

00:05:39.156 --> 00:05:41.245
W-We're nice.
We're really nice.

00:05:41.289 --> 00:05:43.247
Yeah, but not too nice.

00:05:43.291 --> 00:05:46.207
So don't even try it.

00:05:48.035 --> 00:05:49.515
Okay.

00:05:54.084 --> 00:05:55.608
[softly]:
Oh. Hi.

00:05:55.651 --> 00:05:57.479
What is this place?

00:05:57.523 --> 00:06:00.830
It used to be called
Symphonyville.

00:06:00.874 --> 00:06:02.223
[coughs]

00:06:02.266 --> 00:06:05.008
Where the Classical Music
Trolls lived.

00:06:05.052 --> 00:06:09.230
But that was in the before.

00:06:09.273 --> 00:06:10.753
What happened here?

00:06:10.797 --> 00:06:16.280
Well, it was the most wonderful
place you ever did seen.

00:06:16.324 --> 00:06:18.892
[lively classical music
playing, chatter, laughter]

00:06:18.935 --> 00:06:20.720
It was a place where all of

00:06:20.763 --> 00:06:25.159
the Classical Music Trolls
could live in perfect harmony.

00:06:25.202 --> 00:06:27.422
[classical music continues]

00:06:28.249 --> 00:06:29.859
[laughs]:
Ooh.

00:06:29.903 --> 00:06:33.559
Wherever the conductor led,
we followed.

00:06:33.602 --> 00:06:36.431
Play, play. [vocalizes]
Beautiful.

00:06:36.475 --> 00:06:39.956
-[laughs]
-But then Queen Barb showed up.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.044
Oh, no.

00:06:41.088 --> 00:06:42.698
'Sup, Trollzart dude?

00:06:42.742 --> 00:06:44.831
I'm here for your string.

00:06:44.874 --> 00:06:46.876
We will not go quietly.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.704
[playing Beethoven's
"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor"]

00:06:48.748 --> 00:06:50.184
-[triangle dings]
-[Barb snores]

00:06:50.227 --> 00:06:51.838
[sighs]:
Mi, mi, mi, mi, mi.

00:06:51.881 --> 00:06:54.536
Oh. Oh, I'm sorry,
I-I must have fallen asleep,

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.539
because your music
is so boring.

00:06:57.583 --> 00:06:58.584
[scoffs]

00:06:58.627 --> 00:07:00.063
Where are the words, bro?
Right?

00:07:00.107 --> 00:07:01.325
Now give me your string.

00:07:01.369 --> 00:07:03.632
[amplifier buzzes, hums]

00:07:03.676 --> 00:07:06.069
[playing Beethoven's
"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor"]

00:07:06.113 --> 00:07:08.202
-Oh! Oh!
-[Trolls gasping]

00:07:09.029 --> 00:07:11.161
[sighs] No.

00:07:12.293 --> 00:07:14.251
PENNYWHISTLE:
She took our string.

00:07:14.295 --> 00:07:15.426
Our-our music.

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.952
She took everyone.

00:07:18.995 --> 00:07:20.867
[wind whistling softly]

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:24.305
We lost everything.

00:07:27.003 --> 00:07:29.353
Barb doesn't want to unite us.

00:07:30.441 --> 00:07:32.618
She wants to destroy us.

